        "notes": "Since you've made it to round 7 and the game is close, I generally like to pivot into  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f) to take the enemy team off-guard and secure team kills when crucial. Especially with our [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), you can easily get 2-3 Rushes in the round depending on the mode it gives you.\n\nEach optional power could situationally be the better choice, especially if the enemy team isn't playing close together to get the proper value out of crossing guard. If you've got good aim,  [Keen Kunai](item_d5993121-8a5f-4c59-9145-19dc55265f48)  or [Triple Threat](item_fc0e3d9a-5315-41c2-9aa4-331becace714) could be a good way to secure kills and lean into our already strong [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction), whereas [Leaf on the Wind](item_b64de259-d122-407d-a7e4-9d7267310704) is good if your team is struggling to stay alive.\n\n [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) pairs well with  [Crossing Guard](item_bb5252fd-fc6b-4dce-a60a-21b0a0add68f), but if you pick one of the other powers, one of the optional perks may suit your play-style better.",
